                "is_scanned": false,
                "paragraph_count": 109,
                "summary": "The petitioner has approached this Court for a direction to pay the arrears of pension revision from 1.7.2019. Ext.P7 is the order dated 1.9.2023 implementing the revision of pension. Ext.P8 is the calculation statement regarding the arrears of pension to be paid from 1.7.2019 to 31.12.2023. The total amount as on 3.1.2024 comes to Rs.2,40,732/-. The limited relief sought now is for disbursal of the arrears of pension as stated in Ext.P8 within a time frame. The learned Government Pleader seeks time to file counter Taking into consideration of the limited prayer, I direct respondent Nos.1 to 4 to pay the arrears of pension due from 1.7.2019 till date to the petitioner within a period of three months from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment.",
