                "paragraph_count": 99,
                "summary": "The prayer in the writ petition is to quash Exts.P6 and P7 orders rejecting the claim of the petitioner for assignment of the plot in his possession. Today when the matter is taken up, the learned Counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner has surrendered the land and also paid the arrears of rent. The above submission is recorded. It will be open to the Government to take steps in accordance with law, in case it is found that there are arrears outstanding and payable by Subject to the above, Writ Petition is disposed of.",
